fixture tech12_kindle_dash_from_wax_cling_burns_through
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 12 "dash through a wax wall ... to ignite it", from a cling to it (movement review 5, M4). With the Kindle Votive a dash toward a wax wall goes into it, even from a cling: the wax ignites and the dash carries on through. Any other wall, and wax without the Votive, turns the dash away (tech12_dash_from_wax_cling_without_kindle_goes_away; dash_on_cling_frame_goes_away).
room test/wax
spawn 760 544
option kindle 1
frames 40
input
  0..14 R jump
  15..19 R
  20 R dash
  21..39 R
end
expect
  at 16 event.wall_cling=1 state=wall
  at 20 event.dash=1 event.ignite=1 facing=1
  at 29 x>832u
end
